    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Can you be more specific about that \"fragmentation\" risk? I need more than just \"inconsistencies.\" Provide a projection of where exactly the supply chain would break down during a major disruption if we weren't using a centralized orchestration layer. What are the actual projected failure rates for life-critical medication deliveries under the decentralized model?",
